-*   **Inputs:** A tetrahedral mesh with vertex positions, scalar values, and gradient vectors; a camera view matrix; an isosurface level (optional); and a transfer function.
-*   **Outputs:** A 2D color buffer containing the volume-rendered image or isosurface.
